AND HOW THEY'RE DOING,

659
00:24:39,254 --> 00:24:40,422
AND JUST FINISH THIS RACE
ON TOP.

660
00:24:43,125 --> 00:24:46,261
George: NICE. WOW.

661
00:24:46,261 --> 00:24:49,164
IT'S LIKE--
HOW DOES SHE STAY DOWN SO LONG?

662
00:24:49,164 --> 00:24:50,432
SHE'S LIKE THE EVEREADY BUNNY.

663
00:24:50,432 --> 00:24:51,900
SHE JUST KEEPS GOING.

664
00:24:51,900 --> 00:24:53,301
Jay: YOU DON'T HAVE TO
STAY DOWN THERE THAT LONG

665
00:24:53,301 --> 00:24:54,336
IF YOU DON'T WANT TO--
IT'S OKAY.

666
00:24:54,336 --> 00:24:55,337
April: YOU KNOW WHAT?

667
00:24:55,337 --> 00:24:56,438
ACTUALLY, I'M--
Jay: IT'S FINE?

668
00:24:56,438 --> 00:24:58,974
Nolé: APRIL IS LIKE
"CROUCHING TIGER,

669
00:24:58,974 --> 00:25:01,009
HIDDEN DRAGON," "THE MATRIX."

670
00:25:01,009 --> 00:25:04,379
SHE WAS FABULOUS.

671
00:25:04,379 --> 00:25:06,882
Jay: ALL RIGHT, WE'RE READY.

672
00:25:06,882 --> 00:25:07,916
OKAY, YOU CAN GO DOWN, SHANDI.

673
00:25:10,152 --> 00:25:11,486
Nolé: SHE LOOKS CONSTIPATED.

674
00:25:11,486 --> 00:25:12,788
George: HOLD ON A SEC.

675
00:25:12,788 --> 00:25:14,222
Nolé: FROM THE NECK UP,
IT DOES NOT WORK.

676
00:25:14,222 --> 00:25:16,124
Shandi: (coughs)
Jay: YOU ALL RIGHT?

677
00:25:16,124 --> 00:25:20,061
Nolé: SHANDI--
SHE LOOKED PETRIFIED, SCARED,

678
00:25:20,061 --> 00:25:25,033
JUST LIKE A DROWNING CHICKEN.

679
00:25:25,033 --> 00:25:27,002
Mercedes: LUPUS GOES
THROUGH REMISSIONS AND FLARES.

680
00:25:27,002 --> 00:25:28,870
ONE DAY, I'LL BE
REALLY, REALLY TIRED,

681
00:25:28,870 --> 00:25:30,906
AND THE NEXT DAY
IT'LL BE NORMAL FOR TWO DAYS,

682
00:25:30,906 --> 00:25:33,308
BUT RIGHT NOW
I'M FEELING BETTER.

683
00:25:33,308 --> 00:25:34,876
George: WANNA GO DOWN MORE
TO SEE HOW YOU LIKE IT?

684
00:25:40,115 --> 00:25:41,149
George: BEAUTIFUL. WOW.

685
00:25:41,149 --> 00:25:42,784
GORGEOUS.

686
00:25:46,054 --> 00:25:48,957
Nolé: SHE GAVE YOU
WATER COUTURE, HONEY.

687
00:25:48,957 --> 00:25:51,159
THAT WAS WATER COUTURE
ALL THE WAY.

688
00:25:51,159 --> 00:25:52,227
Mercedes: I'M PROUD BECAUSE
I PROVED TO MYSELF,

689
00:25:52,227 --> 00:25:55,263
AND IT'S LIKE GLORIA GAYNOR
SAYS, I WILL SURVIVE

690
00:25:55,263 --> 00:25:58,200
IN THIS COMPETITION.

691
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,936
♪♪♪

692
00:26:00,936 --> 00:26:03,171
Catie: HEY, MERCEDES AND
SARA, COME HERE.

693
00:26:03,171 --> 00:26:05,073
"AS PART OF YOUR CHALLENGE
WIN, A SPECIAL GIFT

694
00:26:05,073 --> 00:26:06,775
IS ARRIVING FOR YOU."

695
00:26:06,775 --> 00:26:08,477
Sara: SHUT UP.

696
00:26:08,477 --> 00:26:09,744
Mercedes: ARE YOU SERIOUS?

697
00:26:09,744 --> 00:26:11,012
I JUST RECEIVED
A SHOPPING SPREE.

698
00:26:11,012 --> 00:26:13,215
WHAT ELSE CAN I RECEIVE,
JEWELRY, DIAMONDS?

699
00:26:13,215 --> 00:26:15,417
I'M THINKING,
I DON'T NEED ANYTHING ELSE.

700
00:26:15,417 --> 00:26:18,353
Catie: AND ALL OF A SUDDEN
THE ELEVATOR DOOR OPENS UP...

701
00:26:18,353 --> 00:26:20,755
Sara: OH, MY GOD!

702
00:26:20,755 --> 00:26:22,290
Catie: AND IT'S THEIR MOMS.

703
00:26:22,290 --> 00:26:24,993
Sara: OH, MY GOD!

704
00:26:24,993 --> 00:26:26,194
Mercedes: I'VE MISSED YOU!

705
00:26:26,194 --> 00:26:27,462
Sara: OH, MY GOD!

706
00:26:27,462 --> 00:26:28,930
Mercedes: SO MANY EMOTIONS.

707
00:26:28,930 --> 00:26:31,166
EVERYTHING I'VE BEEN
GOING THROUGH, I JUST LET IT OUT

708
00:26:31,166 --> 00:26:32,234
WHEN I HUGGED HER.

709
00:26:32,234 --> 00:26:34,169
Sara: OH, MY GOD!

710
00:26:34,169 --> 00:26:37,038
NO, THIS IS JUST, LIKE,
NOT HAPPENING, BUT IT IS.

711
00:26:37,038 --> 00:26:38,440
MY MOM'S RIGHT THERE
IN NEW YORK.

712
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:41,109
OH, MY GOD.

713
00:26:41,109 --> 00:26:43,178
April: SARA AND MERCEDES,
TO ME, HAVE SUCH

714
00:26:43,178 --> 00:26:47,382
AN ETHNIC, FUNKY, TRENDY LOOK,
AND HERE ARE THESE, LIKE,

715
00:26:47,382 --> 00:26:49,718
BLONDE HAIR, WHITE MOMS.

716
00:26:49,718 --> 00:26:51,219
Sara's mother: HI.
Sara: APRIL.

717
00:26:51,219 --> 00:26:53,021
April: BUT I'M USED TO THAT,
BECAUSE YOU LOOK AT MY DAD,

718
00:26:53,021 --> 00:26:54,756
AND YOU LOOK AT ME,
AND IT'S LIKE,

719
00:26:54,756 --> 00:26:55,957
"THAT'S YOUR DAUGHTER?"

720
00:26:55,957 --> 00:26:57,492
'CAUSE HE LOOKS LIKE
ART GARFUNKEL.

721
00:26:57,492 --> 00:27:00,395
Tyra: HEY! MY MAMA'S HERE.

722
00:27:00,395 --> 00:27:03,198
Camille: AND ALL OF A SUDDEN
I HEAR, "AAH!"

723
00:27:03,198 --> 00:27:05,233
AND IT'S TYRA'S MOM,
AND SHE WAS LIKE,

724
00:27:05,233 --> 00:27:08,770
"EVERYBODY, COME,
GIVE ME A HUG."

725
00:27:08,770 --> 00:27:10,438
Mercedes: TYRA'S MOM
COMES OVER, AND WE SIT DOWN,

726
00:27:10,438 --> 00:27:14,743
AND SHE, UH, TELLS US ABOUT
HOW TYRA GOT INTO THE BUSINESS.

727
00:27:14,743 --> 00:27:17,145
Carolyn: SHE GRADUATED
FROM HIGH SCHOOL AT 17,

728
00:27:17,145 --> 00:27:20,916
AND THAT SEPTEMBER,
I STOOD IN THE AIRPORT

729
00:27:20,916 --> 00:27:23,184
AND CRIED UNTIL I WAS SICK.

730
00:27:23,184 --> 00:27:24,719
(laughing)

731
00:27:24,719 --> 00:27:27,122
WAVING AT THE PLANE TAKING OFF.

732
00:27:27,122 --> 00:27:30,025
BY THE TIME SHE LEFT
TO GO TO PARIS,

733
00:27:30,025 --> 00:27:33,161
SHE WAS FULLY
KNOWLEDGEABLE OF EVERYTHING,

734
00:27:33,161 --> 00:27:36,097
INCLUDING THE NEGATIVITIES.

735
00:27:36,097 --> 00:27:39,968
SHE IT TOOK AS A BUSINESS, NOT
AS,"OH, I'M GONNA RUN OVER HERE

736
00:27:39,968 --> 00:27:42,737
AND HAVE SOME FUN
AND BECOME 'FAMOUS'."

737
00:27:42,737 --> 00:27:45,941
SHE DOESN'T GET INVOLVED
WITH DRUGS OR PARTYING

738
00:27:45,941 --> 00:27:48,176
OR THE WRONG MEN.

739
00:27:48,176 --> 00:27:52,948
YOU TRAVEL THE WORLD,
AND YOU'RE IN HOTEL ROOMS ALONE.

740
00:27:52,948 --> 00:27:55,984
YOU TRAVEL TO THE NEXT COUNTRY,
YOU'RE IN AN AIRPLANE--

741
00:27:55,984 --> 00:27:59,087
LOTS OF PEOPLE AROUND YOU,
BUT BASICALLY ALONE.

742
00:27:59,087 --> 00:28:01,323
THAT'S HOW A LOT OF GIRLS
GET IN TROUBLE.

743
00:28:01,323 --> 00:28:05,060
WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO IS
KEEP A STRONG CONNECTION

744
00:28:05,060 --> 00:28:08,229
TO THE PEOPLE WHO WILL BE THERE
WHETHER YOU WIN

745
00:28:08,229 --> 00:28:10,799
OR WHETHER YOU LOSE.

746
00:28:10,799 --> 00:28:12,267
Tyra: I HOPE YOU ALL
SEE YOUR CAREERS AS MORE THAN

747
00:28:12,267 --> 00:28:14,469
JUST BEING CUTE IN MAGAZINES.

748
00:28:14,469 --> 00:28:16,805
YOUNG GIRLS TODAY
HAVE SUCH LOW SELF-ESTEEM,

749
00:28:16,805 --> 00:28:18,873
SO I STARTED A CAMP
CALLED TZONE.

750
00:28:18,873 --> 00:28:20,842
Y'ALL, WHEN I WAS A KID,
I WAS SUPER SKINNY

751
00:28:20,842 --> 00:28:23,144
AND SO INSECURE,
SO I REALLY IDENTIFY

752
00:28:23,144 --> 00:28:24,746
WITH MY GIRLS.

753
00:28:24,746 --> 00:28:28,216
EVERY NIGHT WE TALK ABOUT THINGS
LIKE RELATIONSHIPS AND SEX

754
00:28:28,216 --> 00:28:30,418
AND BEAUTY AND BODY IMAGE.

755
00:28:30,418 --> 00:28:32,721
SO AS A TOP MODEL,
YOU GUYS REALLY CAN INFLUENCE

756
00:28:32,721 --> 00:28:34,789
AND INSPIRE.

757
00:28:34,789 --> 00:28:36,358
NOW IT'S ALSO IMPORTANT
TO LOOK AT YOUR MODELING CAREER

758
00:28:36,358 --> 00:28:38,793
AS A BUSINESS.

759
00:28:38,793 --> 00:28:41,863
THIS INDUSTRY ONLY ALLOWS
FOR ONE PERSON OF COLOR

760
00:28:41,863 --> 00:28:44,032
IN THAT CERTAIN CATEGORY
AT A TIME.

761
00:28:44,032 --> 00:28:46,768
SO, LIKE, APRIL, IF YOU MAKE IT,
YOU KNOW, YOU ARE THE TOP

762
00:28:46,768 --> 00:28:49,471
ASIAN GIRL AT THE MOMENT,
OR CAMILLE OR, YOU KNOW,

763
00:28:49,471 --> 00:28:52,474
XIOMARA, YOU GUYS ARE THE TOP
"BLACK" OR "LATIN" GIRLS.

764
00:28:52,474 --> 00:28:54,109
Sara: I MAY NOT LOOK
FULLY MIDDLE EASTERN,

765
00:28:54,109 --> 00:28:56,244
BUT I'D LIKE TO REPRESENT
A GOOD IMAGE

766
00:28:56,244 --> 00:28:58,913
FOR MIDDLE EASTERN WOMEN.

767
00:28:58,913 --> 00:29:01,249
April: NOW I REALIZE
YOU CAN'T TAKE IT PERSONALLY.

768
00:29:01,249 --> 00:29:02,984
I'M VERY BUSINESS-MINDED.

769
00:29:02,984 --> 00:29:06,755
I UNDERSTAND THAT, YES, MY LOOK
IS MUCH MORE DOMINANTLY ASIAN

770
00:29:06,755 --> 00:29:09,891
THAN WHITE, THEREFORE I MUST
MARKET MYSELF THAT WAY

771
00:29:09,891 --> 00:29:11,459
TO BE SUCCESSFUL.

772
00:29:11,459 --> 00:29:12,494
Tyra: BYE!

773
00:29:12,494 --> 00:29:13,995
Women: BYE!

774
00:29:13,995 --> 00:29:15,230
Xiomara: TYRA'S MOTHER
IS SO CUTE.

775
00:29:15,230 --> 00:29:17,899
I FELT AS IF MY MOM WAS HERE
IN SPIRIT.

776
00:29:25,507 --> 00:29:27,108
Sara's mother: IT'S HARD
TO SAY WITH YOUR DAD.

777
00:29:27,108 --> 00:29:28,810
YOU HAVE NO CONTROL OVER
WHAT HE THINKS

778
00:29:28,810 --> 00:29:30,845
AND SAYS OR ANYTHING, HONEY.

779
00:29:30,845 --> 00:29:31,946
YOU KNOW THAT IT'S CULTURAL.

780
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:38,186
SARA, THEY LOVE YOU--
THEY'RE NOT GONNA HATE YOU.

781
00:29:38,186 --> 00:29:40,221
THEY'RE GONNA BE SO HAPPY
FOR YOU.

782
00:29:40,221 --> 00:29:41,289
DON'T BE AFRAID OF IT.

783
00:29:41,289 --> 00:29:43,191
YOU EARNED THIS.

784
00:29:43,191 --> 00:29:46,061
SO JUST GET OUT THERE
AND BE SARA.

785
00:29:46,061 --> 00:29:47,996
Sara: MY MOM HAS JUST
INCREASED MY CONFIDENCE

786
00:29:47,996 --> 00:29:50,231
ABOUT A MILLION PERCENT.

787
00:29:50,231 --> 00:29:52,500
Shandi: WATCHING, YOU KNOW,
MERCEDES AND SARA, IT'S LIKE,

788
00:29:52,500 --> 00:29:54,736
THEIR MOMS KNOW THEM
THROUGH AND THROUGH,

789
00:29:54,736 --> 00:29:56,838
AND OF COURSE, IT MAKES ME SAD.

790
00:29:56,838 --> 00:30:00,108
IT MAKES ME THINK ABOUT HOW
I'M NOT THAT WAY WITH MY MOM.

791
00:30:00,108 --> 00:30:02,210
Mercedes: WELL, I ASKED HIM,
LIKE, HOW MANY PEOPLE, YOU KNOW,

792
00:30:02,210 --> 00:30:04,012
HAVE RECOVERED FROM THIS--
AND HE'S LIKE--

793
00:30:04,012 --> 00:30:05,413
Mercedes' mother:
NOBODY RECOVERS-- IT'S CHRONIC.

794
00:30:05,413 --> 00:30:06,748
YOU'LL NEVER GET RID OF IT.

795
00:30:06,748 --> 00:30:08,349
Mercedes: I KNOW, BUT--
Mercedes' mother: I KNOW

796
00:30:08,349 --> 00:30:10,752
YOU DON'T WANNA HEAR THAT,
BUT THAT'S THE REALITY, SO...

797
00:30:14,222 --> 00:30:17,726
Mercedes: SORRY.

798
00:30:17,726 --> 00:30:19,160
IT JUST SUCKS, 'CAUSE, YOU KNOW?

799
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,862
Mercedes' mother: I KNOW--
I KNOW IT'S SUCKS.

800
00:30:26,367 --> 00:30:28,970
Mercedes: (crying)

801
00:30:28,970 --> 00:30:31,106
Mercedes: IF I SHOW GOD
AND MY FAMILY

802
00:30:31,106 --> 00:30:34,442
THAT I CAN BE STRONG,
THAT NOTHING COULD HURT ME

803
00:30:34,442 --> 00:30:36,377
WITH THIS DISEASE.

804
00:30:36,377 --> 00:30:38,146
I WANNA GO AS FAR AS I CAN,
YOU KNOW?

805
00:30:38,146 --> 00:30:39,414
Sara's mother: TAKE CARE.

806
00:30:39,414 --> 00:30:41,082
BYE-BYE.

807
00:30:41,082 --> 00:30:43,885
Shandi: JUST SEEING HOW MUCH
THEY'VE BEEN THERE

808
00:30:43,885 --> 00:30:46,421
FOR EACH OTHER,
AND THAT THEY'RE A REAL FAMILY

809
00:30:46,421 --> 00:30:47,455
AND THEY LOVE EACH OTHER...

810
00:30:47,455 --> 00:30:49,224
Sara's mother: BYE, GUYS!

811
00:30:49,224 --> 00:30:50,492
Shandi: EVEN THOUGH
WE'RE IN A COMPETITION,

812
00:30:50,492 --> 00:30:54,429
AND WE'RE TRYING TO BEAT
ONE ANOTHER, WE'RE A FAMILY.

813
00:30:54,429 --> 00:30:56,331
ONE OF US IS GOING TO GO HOME
TOMORROW.

814
00:30:56,331 --> 00:30:57,265
IT MAKES ME SAD.

815
00:31:08,358 --> 00:31:09,860
Tyra: HELLO, EVERYBODY.

816
00:31:09,860 --> 00:31:11,128
Yoanna: HELLO.
Catie: HELLO.

817
00:31:11,128 --> 00:31:13,263
Tyra: NOW IT'S TIME TO MAKE
OUR FIFTH ELIMINATION

818
00:31:13,263 --> 00:31:15,866
TOWARDS DETERMINING WHO WILL BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

819
00:31:15,866 --> 00:31:17,868
THE WINNER WILL RECEIVE
A CONTRACT

820
00:31:17,868 --> 00:31:20,003
WITH MY MODELING AGENCY--
IMG MODELS,

821
00:31:20,003 --> 00:31:22,372
A PHOTO SPREAD
IN "JANE" MAGAZINE

822
00:31:22,372 --> 00:31:25,041
AND A COSMETICS CAMPAIGN
WITH SEPHORA.

823
00:31:25,041 --> 00:31:27,210
AND WE HAVE
OUR PANEL OF JUDGES HERE.

824
00:31:27,210 --> 00:31:29,913
FIRST, WE HAVE
MISS JANICE DICKINSON.

825
00:31:29,913 --> 00:31:32,182
SHE IS
THE VERY FIRST SUPERMODEL.

826
00:31:32,182 --> 00:31:34,117
WE HAVE ERIC NICHOLSON-- ERIC IS
THE SENIOR FASHION EDITOR

827
00:31:34,117 --> 00:31:36,620
AT "JANE" MAGAZINE.

828
00:31:36,620 --> 00:31:39,022
NIGEL BARKER,
NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER,

829
00:31:39,022 --> 00:31:42,225
AND LAST BUT NOT LEAST,
WE HAVE OUR SPECIAL GUEST JUDGE.

830
00:31:42,225 --> 00:31:44,895
NOLé MARIN IS YOUR STYLIST
ON YOUR UNDERWATER SHOOT.

831
00:31:44,895 --> 00:31:46,730
Nolé: AND EMPRESS MINI,
AS YOU ALL KNOW.

832
00:31:46,730 --> 00:31:47,964
(Mini barks)

833
00:31:47,964 --> 00:31:49,166
Tyra: SO WE'RE GONNA BRING
YOU IN ONE BY ONE

834
00:31:49,166 --> 00:31:50,967
FOR YOUR INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS.

835
00:31:50,967 --> 00:31:52,903
AFTER THAT,
THE JUDGES WILL DELIBERATE,

836
00:31:52,903 --> 00:31:54,004
AND WE'LL DETERMINE
WHICH ONE OF YOU

837
00:31:54,004 --> 00:31:55,372
SHOULD BE ELIMINATED.

838
00:31:55,372 --> 00:31:56,840
Janice: THIS WEEK
YOU WILL BE TESTED

839
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:59,176
ON YOUR ABILITY TO ACT
AS A SPOKESMODEL

840
00:31:59,176 --> 00:32:03,013
FOR A PRETEND COSMETICS LINE
NAMED ANTM BEAUTY.

841
00:32:03,013 --> 00:32:05,715
YOU WILL BE EVALUATED ON
HOW WELL YOU PRESENT YOURSELVES

842
00:32:05,715 --> 00:32:07,250
FOR 60 SECONDS.

843
00:32:07,250 --> 00:32:08,318
Sara: HI, YOU GUYS.

844
00:32:08,318 --> 00:32:09,719
I'M HERE TO PROMOTE
MY NEW BEAUTY LINE,

845
00:32:09,719 --> 00:32:10,754
ANTM BEAUTY.

846
00:32:10,754 --> 00:32:12,355
WE HAVE
500 DIFFERENT COMBINATIONS,

847
00:32:12,355 --> 00:32:13,924
SO WE ARE VERY VERSATILE.

848
00:32:13,924 --> 00:32:17,093
SO YOU WALK INTO MY--
MY BEAUTY SALON,

849
00:32:17,093 --> 00:32:18,028
I WILL HOOK YOU UP,
AND YOU WILL LOOK LIKE

850
00:32:18,028 --> 00:32:19,262
TYRA BANKS.

851
00:32:19,262 --> 00:32:20,931
AND IF YOU WANT TO SEND IT
AS A GIFT,

852
00:32:20,931 --> 00:32:22,265
WE CAN HOOK YOU
UP WITH THAT AS WELL.

853
00:32:22,265 --> 00:32:23,733
Janice: TIME.

854
00:32:23,733 --> 00:32:25,368
Eric: YOU STARTED OFF
SO STRONG,

855
00:32:25,368 --> 00:32:27,003
BUT THEN YOU GOT NERVOUS.

856
00:32:27,003 --> 00:32:29,739
THAT'S WHEN YOU KINDA FELL
INTO THE HOMEGIRL THING.

857
00:32:29,739 --> 00:32:31,174
Tyra: ALL RIGHT, SARA,
YOU HAD

858
00:32:31,174 --> 00:32:34,711
AN UNDERWATER PHOTO SHOOT,
AND HERE IS YOUR BEST PICTURE.

859
00:32:34,711 --> 00:32:36,346
Janice: WOW.
Eric: WHOA.

860
00:32:36,346 --> 00:32:37,681
Janice: I DIG BICEPS
AND EVERYTHING,

861
00:32:37,681 --> 00:32:39,182
BUT IT'S A LITTLE TOO BICEP-Y.

862
00:32:39,182 --> 00:32:41,384
Tyra: LOOK AT THE INTENSITY
IN YOUR EYES, MISS SARA.

863
00:32:41,384 --> 00:32:42,852
Nigel: YOU LOOK FANTASTIC.

864
00:32:42,852 --> 00:32:44,254
YOUR EYES--
THE BEST I'VE SEEN THEM.

865
00:32:44,254 --> 00:32:45,989
Sara: THANKS.

866
00:32:45,989 --> 00:32:47,290
Janice: THESE GIRLS WANT
TO BE AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL

867
00:32:47,290 --> 00:32:50,126
SO MUCH, THEY'RE ABLE
TO BREATHE UNDERWATER

868
00:32:50,126 --> 00:32:52,195
TO GET THE TITLE, ANYTHING.

869
00:32:52,195 --> 00:32:54,264
April: ANTM UNDERSTANDS
THAT EVERY WOMAN NEEDS

870
00:32:54,264 --> 00:32:57,167
THEIR OWN CUSTOMIZED
BRAND OF MAKEUP,

871
00:32:57,167 --> 00:32:59,869
AND WE ALSO UNDERSTAND
THAT YOUR BODY IS IMPORTANT.

872
00:32:59,869 --> 00:33:02,372
THAT'S WHY WE HAVE TESTED
ALL OF OUR MAKEUPS TO MAKE SURE

873
00:33:02,372 --> 00:33:04,975
THAT THEY'RE 100% ALLERGY-FREE.

874
00:33:04,975 --> 00:33:06,243
Janice: I'D LIKE TO SEE
A LITTLE MORE WARMTH

875
00:33:06,243 --> 00:33:08,011
IN YOUR EYES.

876
00:33:08,011 --> 00:33:10,714
WHEN YOU'RE SELLING THE PRODUCT,
A LITTLE MORE LOVE COMING OUT.

877
00:33:10,714 --> 00:33:11,881
Eric: IT WAS LIKE
WE WERE WATCHING AN INFOMERCIAL

