1098
00:40:42,797 --> 00:40:45,633
BUT ON PHOTO SHOOTS,
YOU LOSE YOUR FOCUS

1099
00:40:45,633 --> 00:40:48,403
AND DON'T TAKE DIRECTION WELL.

1100
00:40:48,403 --> 00:40:49,971
BUT NEVERTHELESS,
I'M ALL ABOUT A GIRL

1101
00:40:49,971 --> 00:40:52,240
WITH PERSONALITY.

1102
00:40:58,780 --> 00:41:00,248
Tyra: CAMILLE.

1103
00:41:00,248 --> 00:41:01,883
CONGRATULATIONS.

1104
00:41:01,883 --> 00:41:03,017
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1105
00:41:03,017 --> 00:41:04,552
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1106
00:41:04,552 --> 00:41:06,087
THANK YOU, XIOMARA.

1107
00:41:06,087 --> 00:41:09,357
♪♪♪

1108
00:41:15,630 --> 00:41:17,599
Xiomara: I LOVE SHANDI
AND YOANNA AND APRIL

1109
00:41:17,599 --> 00:41:18,833
AND EVERYONE.

1110
00:41:18,833 --> 00:41:20,869
I LOVE YOU. I LOVE YOU.

1111
00:41:20,869 --> 00:41:22,504
TAKE CARE.

1112
00:41:23,805 --> 00:41:24,873
I DIDN'T WANNA BE ELIMINATED.

1113
00:41:24,873 --> 00:41:25,974
WHO WANTS TO BE ELIMINATED?

1114
00:41:25,974 --> 00:41:27,609
I DON'T WANNA GO HOME.

1115
00:41:27,609 --> 00:41:30,245
I LEARNED THAT YOU CAN NEVER
LISTEN TO ANYONE BUT YOURSELF.

1116
00:41:30,245 --> 00:41:31,646
GO WITH YOU.

1117
00:41:31,646 --> 00:41:33,681
DON'T TRY TO BE SOMETHING
THAT YOU'RE NOT.

1118
00:41:33,681 --> 00:41:35,316
BESIDES BEING BORN,
THIS IS THE BEST THING

1119
00:41:35,316 --> 00:41:36,718
THAT'S EVER HAPPENED TO ME.

1120
00:41:36,718 --> 00:41:40,255
♪♪♪

1121
00:41:47,462 --> 00:41:49,230
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1122
00:41:53,655 --> 00:41:56,191
HERE'S WHAT'S COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1123
00:41:56,191 --> 00:41:57,492
Yoanna: WHAT DO YOU EXPECT?

1124
00:41:57,492 --> 00:41:58,627
WE'VE BEEN STUCK WITH 12 GIRLS.

1125
00:41:58,627 --> 00:42:00,662
IT'S TIME FOR SOME TESTOSTERONE.

1126
00:42:00,662 --> 00:42:02,664
Tyra: SOME GIRLS
ACT LIKE DRAMA QUEENS...

1127
00:42:02,664 --> 00:42:03,865
Shandi: I HATE YOU!

1128
00:42:03,865 --> 00:42:06,635
Camille: OH, MY GOD.

1129
00:42:06,635 --> 00:42:08,203
Tyra: BUT CAMILLE
MISSES HER CUE.

1130
00:42:08,203 --> 00:42:09,538
Camille: (stilted voice)
I DIDN'T BELIEVE IT.

1131
00:42:09,538 --> 00:42:11,039
IT'S TRUE. YOU ARE ALIVE.

1132
00:42:11,039 --> 00:42:12,507
Woman: I THOUGHT
IT WAS HORRIBLE.

1133
00:42:12,507 --> 00:42:14,209
(record needle scratches)

1134
00:42:19,114 --> 00:42:22,150
♪♪♪

